{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/370719-teleportation-clairvoyant-sight-combo-problem","id":370719,"title":"teleportation + Clairvoyant Sight combo problem","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-01-14T21:08:52-08:00","id":370719,"title":"teleportation + Clairvoyant Sight combo problem","content":"Clairvoyant Sight stated that the demon loses his vision if he take an action other than stop the vision. But a teleportation is a reflective action. which effect come first? does demon's teleportation fail with a Captivated Condition, or he successes with a Captivated Condition?<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4269-z5323999","name":"z5323999","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T17:57:28-08:00","id":423639,"title":"","content":"I'm a fan of being able to combo these powers. So the demon can teleport to the location he's viewing but gains Captivated from recursively seeing himself seeing himself seeing himself... until he turns the power off.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cRxoek0ln6Q\" data-code=\"cRxoek0ln6Q\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/cRxoek0ln6Q/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thread Reaper <span style=\"color:#404040\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">\uff1c(\u00b4 \u055e)\u0a0a( \u055e )\uff1e\ufeff</span></span>","edited":{"userid":377,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","user":"Xanandithras","date":". 02-28-2015, 09:07 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/377-xanandithras","name":"Xanandithras","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar377_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"427"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T20:48:28-08:00","id":423770,"title":"","content":"The way I've read Clairvoyant Sight, it's not <i>taking</i> any action that breaks the mind a bit and makes you Captivated, but specifically the phrasing they use (emphasis) - if &quot;anything <b>forces</b> the demon to take an action before he chooses to stop concentrating on the vision.&quot; If you choose to teleport (or talk on a cell phone, etc), it doesn't break you. If you're suddenly distracted by a loud noise or shoved, then you're stuck Captivated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1134-nicias","name":"Nicias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"274"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T21:28:00-08:00","id":423809,"title":"","content":"I allow it. It's interesting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T05:02:01-08:00","id":423996,"title":"","content":"I'm with Nicias. That line reminded me of the old Auspex &quot;Loud noise stuns you!&quot; thing. So, its less an issue of the Demon doing something, and more of an &quot;Oh shit explosion just happened! What's going on!?&quot; thing.<br /> <br /> That said, I don't think that being able to Teleport through your Clairvoyance is something I would allow. I just feel that's against the intent of the power. By that rationale, you should be able to use a video feed to teleport anywhere. Line of sight is a direct line from the demon's body is how I would rule it.<br /> <br /> If you want long distant teleportation, that's what Behind the Curtain is for.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2102,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","user":"MCN","date":". 03-01-2015, 08:06 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2102-mcn","name":"MCN","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2102_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3479"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}